---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /catalog/index.html
canonicalPath: "/catalog"
seoTitle: "Story Crossroads Bookshelf | Interactive Editions"
seoDescription: "Browse RaggieSoft Story Crossroads interactive novels, featuring The Uncharted Waystation and Cedar Run—free in RaggieSoft Book Reader."
---
{#
  ============================================================================
  src/site/catalog.njk — Imprint Bookshelf (`https://crossroads.raggiesoft.com/catalog`)
  ============================================================================
  PLAIN-ENGLISH OVERVIEW:
    Displays all published RaggieSoft Story Crossroads interactive editions with
    direct links to RaggieSoft Book Reader (`books.raggiesoft.com`) and each
    book's companion world portal (`waystation.raggiesoft.com` & `cedarrun.raggiesoft.com`).
  ============================================================================
#}

<section class="cr-section cr-mt-0" aria-labelledby="catalog-heading">
  <span class="cr-eyebrow">
    <span aria-hidden="true">📚</span>
    <span>Official Imprint Bookshelf</span>
  </span>
  <h1 id="catalog-heading" class="cr-hero-title">RaggieSoft Story Crossroads Editions</h1>
  <p class="cr-lead">
    Every edition below is free to read online in RaggieSoft Book Reader—with automatic route memory
    and one-tap signpost returns whenever you want to explore a different path.
  </p>

  {% for book in imprint.editions %}
  <article class="cr-book-showcase">
    <img
      src="{{ book.cover2x3 }}"
      alt="{{ book.title }} cover stamped with the 3-Way RaggieSoft Story Crossroads seal"
      width="260"
      height="390"
      class="cr-book-cover"
    />
    <div>
      <span class="cr-eyebrow">{{ book.directionsLabel }} • {{ book.eraLabel }}</span>
      <h2 class="cr-section-title cr-mt-0">{{ book.title }}: {{ book.subtitle }}</h2>
      <p class="cr-card-body" style="margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">{{ book.synopsis }}</p>
      <p class="cr-card-body"><em>{{ book.architectNote }}</em></p>

      <ul class="cr-route-list" aria-label="Routes available in {{ book.title }}">
        {% for route in book.routes %}
        <li class="cr-route-item">
          <span class="cr-route-badge">{{ route.badge }}</span>
          <strong>{{ route.name }}</strong>
          <p class="cr-card-body">{{ route.summary }}</p>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>

      <div class="cr-actions">
        <a href="{{ book.readUrl }}" class="cr-btn cr-btn-primary">
          <span aria-hidden="true">📖</span>
          <span>Read {{ book.title }} in Book Reader</span>
        </a>
        <a href="{{ book.worldUrl }}" class="cr-btn cr-btn-secondary">
          <span aria-hidden="true">{{ book.worldIcon }}</span>
          <span>{{ book.worldLabel }}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
